{"seq":2,"slug":"app-store-aso-launch","title":"App Store 上架与 ASO","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# App Store 上架与 ASO 简介\n\n做好了产品，还要让目标用户在应用商店找到它、点进来、并下载——这是 ASO（应用商店优化）与上架的功夫。本 hub 面向要把 app 推上 App Store / Google Play 的独立开发者，从商店列表优化（标题副标题图标、截图预览、描述转化）讲起，覆盖关键词与排名（关键词调研、ASO 排名因素、iOS 与 Android 的差异）、评分与评价（为何重要、如何请求、应对差评），以及审核与发布（审核流程、常见拒审、发布日运作）。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：把第一眼三件套和截图做到位（转化权重最高）、主攻中长尾关键词、用真实好产品和主动引导经营评分、为审核留缓冲——而发布日只是长跑的起点，持续的优化与迭代才是独立 app 增长的重头。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"store-listing","title":"Store Listing","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"title-subtitle-icon","title":"标题、副标题与图标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing/title-subtitle-icon"},{"seq":2,"slug":"screenshots-and-preview","title":"截图与预览视频","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing/screenshots-and-preview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"description-and-conversion","title":"描述与转化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/store-listing/description-and-conversion"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"keywords-and-ranking","title":"Keywords And Ranking","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"keyword-research","title":"关键词调研","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking/keyword-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aso-ranking-factors","title":"ASO 排名因素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/app-store-aso-launch/keywords-and-ranking/aso-ranking-factors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ios-vs-android-aso","title":"iOS 与 Android 的 ASO 差异","ur